error [AUTOSQL001] public.customers
  object is dropped
  impact: Definite data loss or loss of a database API.
  remediation: Deprecate consumers, retain or archive data, then drop in a later release.
warning [AUTOSQL101] public.customers
  DDL requires ACCESS EXCLUSIVE lock
  impact: Concurrent reads or writes can wait behind the migration.
  remediation: Set lock_timeout and schedule the contract step after dependencies are removed.
